Beam
====

Third-party names
-----------------
This software interoperates with Apple TV / AirPlay-compatible devices and
runs on Android. Those product names and related marks belong to their
respective owners. Beam does not claim any sponsorship, endorsement, or
official status.

No Apple, Google, or Disney (etc.) logos or trademarked glyphs are shipped
as Beam branding. The Beam icon is original artwork for this project.

Dependencies
------------
Beam embeds or links to open-source components under their own licenses,
notably pyatv and the AndroidX / Material libraries. See those projects for
terms.
